    <briefdescription>
<para>Public API for NDXL edge creation, state and parameter management, and vertex inspection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Declares the <ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1aa30ac2f40da4dbe7d841088a78f957fe" kindref="member">NDXLEdge</ref> object, representing an edge in a network. Provides functions for edge construction, destruction, vertex inspection, and state and parameter querying.</para>
